     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\">Hi All,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">     I was running into some\r\nissues with trying to get the micro_USA() function (accessed from github) to\r\nrun. I was hoping to get it running first before changing the code for future climate scenarios.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">In the function, spatial = “N:/USA”, and despite changing it I run into\r\nseveral different issues. The most common is the following (using the\r\ntraceback):<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">&gt; USA&lt;-micro_USA()<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Error in .local(.Object, ...) : <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Error in .rasterObjectFromFile(x, band = band, objecttype =\r\n&quot;RasterLayer&quot;,  : <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">  Cannot create a RasterLayer\r\nobject from this file. (file does not exist)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">7.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">stop(&quot;Cannot create a RasterLayer object from this file. (file\r\n  does not exist)&quot;)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">6.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">.rasterObjectFromFile(x, band = band, objecttype =\r\n  &quot;RasterLayer&quot;, ...)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">5.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">.local(x, ...)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">4.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">raster(paste0(spatial, &quot;/PRISM_us_dem_4km_asc.asc&quot;))<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">3.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">raster(paste0(spatial, &quot;/PRISM_us_dem_4km_asc.asc&quot;))<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">2.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">extract(raster(paste0(spatial,\r\n  &quot;/PRISM_us_dem_4km_asc.asc&quot;)), x)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">1.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">micro_USA()<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Downloading the .asc file and trying to extract the raster layer from a\r\ndirect filepath gets me the following issue:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">&gt; USA&lt;-micro_USA()<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">OVER_QUERY_LIMIT:Madison,Wisconsin<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">[1] &quot;try 2 ...&quot;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">[1] &quot;try 3 ...&quot;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">[2018-02-15 11:51:03] Exception: Do not know how to unwrap object:\r\nRasterLayer<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">  at #03.\r\nextract.default(raster(paste0(&quot;C:/global climate&quot;,\r\n&quot;/PRISM_us_dem_4km_asc.asc&quot;)), <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">              x)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">          - extract.default() is\r\nin environment &#39;R.utils&#39;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">  at #02.\r\nextract(raster(paste0(&quot;C:/global climate&quot;,\r\n&quot;/PRISM_us_dem_4km_asc.asc&quot;)), <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">              x)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">          - extract() is in\r\nenvironment &#39;R.utils&#39;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">  at #01. micro_USA()<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">          - micro_USA() is in environment &#39;R_GlobalEnv&#39;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Error: Do not know how to unwrap object: RasterLayer<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">8.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">stop(cond)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">7.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">throw.Exception(Exception(...))<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">6.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">throw(Exception(...))<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">5.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">throw.default(&quot;Do not know how to unwrap object: &quot;,\r\n  class(x)[1L])<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">4.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">throw(&quot;Do not know how to unwrap object: &quot;, class(x)[1L])<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">3.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">extract.default(raster(paste0(&quot;C:/global climate&quot;,\r\n  &quot;/PRISM_us_dem_4km_asc.asc&quot;)), x)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">2.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">extract(raster(paste0(&quot;C:/global climate&quot;,\r\n  &quot;/PRISM_us_dem_4km_asc.asc&quot;)), x)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"display:none\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"3\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"24\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:.25in;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">1.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">micro_USA()<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">I don’t know whether the issue is because micro_USA is not part of NicheMapR\r\nv1.1.3 or I do not have access to the appropriate files because I am not\r\naffiliated with University of Idaho. I run into similar issues when I try running the micro_aust() or micro_aust_forecast().<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Apologies for any ignorance on my part.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Cheers,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Adam<u></u><u></u></p></div>"
