     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\">Thanks for the response earlier Michael! <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">     So after the new release for\r\nNicheMapR v1.1.4 I went through and reinstalled everything. I am running this\r\nthrough Windows, but I have been trying to troubleshoot the package.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Using ncdf4 v1.15 recommended from the releases page, here is the\r\nfollowing issue I run into: <u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">OVER_QUERY_LIMIT:Manns+Harbor,North+Carolina,USA<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">[1] &quot;try 2 ...&quot;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">OVER_QUERY_LIMIT:Manns+Harbor,North+Carolina,USA<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">[1] &quot;try 3 ...&quot;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">[1] &quot;try 4 ...&quot;<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">extracting elevation via opendaps <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">extracting weather data <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">reading weather input for 01/01/2014 to 31/12/2014 <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">tmin weather input <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><b>Error in\r\nRsx_nc4_get_vara_double: NetCDF: Index exceeds dimension bound<u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Var: daily_minimum_temperature \r\nNdims: 3   Start: 12784,1176,260\r\nCount: 365,1,1<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><b>Error in\r\nncvar_get_inner(ncid2use, varid2use, nc$var[[li]]$missval, addOffset,  : <u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><b> \r\nC function R_nc4_get_vara_double returned error<u></u><u></u></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">ERROR [2018-07-05 12:53:21] retry: error in attempt 1/50 [[Class\r\n&#39;try-error&#39;  atomic [1:1] Error in\r\nncvar_get_inner(ncid2use, varid2use, nc$var[[li]]$missval, addOffset,  : ]]<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">ERROR [2018-07-05 12:53:21] retry: error in attempt 1/50 [[  C function R_nc4_get_vara_do| __truncated__]]<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">ERROR [2018-07-05 12:53:21] retry: error in attempt 1/50 [[  ..- attr(*, &quot;condition&quot;)=List of\r\n2]]<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">ERROR [2018-07-05 12:53:21] retry: error in attempt 1/50 [[  .. ..$ message: chr &quot;C function\r\nR_nc4_get_vara_double returned error&quot;]]<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">ERROR [2018-07-05 12:53:21] retry: error in attempt 1/50 [[  .. ..$ call  \r\n: language ncvar_get_inner(ncid2use, varid2use, nc$var[[li]]$missval,\r\naddOffset, scaleFact, start = start, count = count,   | __truncated__]]<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">ERROR [2018-07-05 12:53:21] retry: error in attempt 1/50 [[  .. ..- attr(*, &quot;class&quot;)= chr [1:3]\r\n&quot;simpleError&quot; &quot;error&quot; &quot;condition&quot;]]<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Error in Rsx_nc4_get_vara_double: NetCDF: Index exceeds dimension bound<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Var: daily_minimum_temperature \r\nNdims: 3   Start: 12784,1176,260\r\nCount: 365,1,1<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Error in ncvar_get_inner(ncid2use, varid2use, nc$var[[li]]$missval,\r\naddOffset,  : <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">  C function\r\nR_nc4_get_vara_double returned error<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">In addition: Warning messages:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">1: In retry(as.numeric(ncvar_get(nc, varid =\r\n&quot;daily_minimum_temperature&quot;,  :<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">  retry: error in attempt 1/50\r\n[[Class &#39;try-error&#39;  atomic [1:1] Error\r\nin ncvar_get_inner(ncid2use, varid2use, nc$var[[li]]$missval, addOffset,  : ]]retry: error in attempt 1/50 [[  C function R_nc4_get_vara_do|\r\n__truncated__]]retry: error in attempt 1/50 [[ \r\n..- attr(*, &quot;condition&quot;)=List of 2]]retry: error in attempt\r\n1/50 [[  .. ..$ message: chr &quot;C\r\nfunction R_nc4_get_vara_double returned error&quot;]]retry: error in attempt\r\n1/50 [[  .. ..$ call   : language ncvar_get_inner(ncid2use,\r\nvarid2use, nc$var[[li]]$missval, addOffset, scaleFact, start = start, count =\r\ncount,   | __truncated__]]retry: error in\r\nattempt 1/50 [[  .. ..- attr(*,\r\n&quot;class&quot;)= chr [1:3] &quot;simpleError&quot; &quot;error&quot;\r\n&quot;condition&quot;]]<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">2: In eval(expr) : restarting interrupted promise evaluation<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">_____________________________________________</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"> <br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">This will continue for 50 iterations. I went through and tried to look\r\nup different errors (bolded), and don’t know whether the coordinates are being\r\nimported properly or what.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">And to cover my bases, updating to ncdf4 v1.16 (same issue I ran into last time before the new\r\nNicheMapR package was released) gives me similar issues as before, so the recommended v1.15 is doing the trick. Do I need to modify the coordinates I am putting in or do I need to change the source code somewhere?</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Cheers,</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Adam</p></div>"
    ]
   ]
